{"compound":{"cid":5280492,"queryId":"C02165","title":"Leukotriene B4","formula":"C20H32O4","molecularWeight":"336.5","iupacName":"(5S,6Z,8E,10E,12R,14Z)-5,12-dihydroxyicosa-6,8,10,14-tetraenoic acid","inchiKey":"VNYSSYRCGWBHLG-AMOLWHMGSA-N","description":{"text":"Leukotriene B4 is a leukotriene composed of (6Z,8E,10E,14Z)-icosatetraenoic acid having (5S)- and (12R)-hydroxy substituents. It is a lipid mediator of inflammation that is generated from arachidonic acid via the 5-lipoxygenase pathway. It has a role as a vasoconstrictor agent, a mouse metabolite, a plant metabolite and a human metabolite. It is a hydroxy polyunsaturated fatty acid, a long-chain fatty acid, a leukotriene and a dihydroxy monocarboxylic acid. It is functionally related to an icosa-6,8,10,14-tetraenoic acid. It is a conjugate acid of a leukotriene B4(1-).","source":"ChEBI"},"synonyms":["LEUKOTRIENE B4","LTB4","71160-24-2","5,12-Hete","(5S,6Z,8E,10E,12R,14Z)-5,12-dihydroxyicosa-6,8,10,14-tetraenoic acid","LEUKOTRIENE_B4","1HGW4DR56D","5S,12R-dihydroxy-6Z,8E,10E,14Z-eicosatetraenoic acid","5S,12R-diHETE","DTXSID4037162","CHEBI:15647","(6z,8e,10e,14z)-(5s,12r)-5,12-dihydroxyicosa-6,8,10,14-tetraenoate","Leukotriene B","5,12 diHETE","Leukotriene B 4","Leukotriene B-4","B-4, Leukotriene","RefChem:153149","5,12 HETE","DTXCID401765891","6,8,10,14-Eicosatetraenoic acid, 5,12-dihydroxy-, (S-(R*,S*-(E,Z,E,Z)))-","CHEMBL65061","MFCD00135630","6,8,10,14-Eicosatetraenoic acid, 5,12-dihydroxy-, (5S,6Z,8E,10E,12R,14Z)-","(S-(R*,S*-(E,Z,E,Z)))-5,12-Dihydroxy-6,8,10,14-eicosatetraenoic acid","6,8,10,14-Eicosatetraenoicacid, 5,12-dihydroxy-, (5S,6Z,8E,10E,12R,14Z)-","101759-15-3","UNII-1HGW4DR56D","LTB 4 free acid","starbld0009609","BSPBio_001364","LEUKOTRIENE B4 [MI]","BML1-E04","GTPL2487","orb1989612","SCHEMBL2510602","DIHETE 12(s), 5(s)","HMS1361E06","HMS1791E06","HMS1989E06","HMS3402E06","Leukotriene B4; 5S,12R-diHETE","BDBM50013889","LMFA03020001","PDSP1_000573","PDSP1_000684","PDSP2_000571","PDSP2_000674